@Host = http://localhost:5217

### Comprehensive Health Check (JSON report with Redis & SQL Server latency)
GET {{Host}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Readiness Probe
GET {{Host}}/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Liveness Probe
GET {{Host}}/health/live

### Live Server Telemetry (Active SignalR Connections, Placements, Uptime)
GET {{Host}}/api/canvas/telemetry
Accept: application/json

### Active Color Palette (32 Curated Painting Colors)
GET {{Host}}/api/canvas/palette?activeOnly=true
Accept: application/json

### Full 256-Color Palette
GET {{Host}}/api/canvas/palette
Accept: application/json

### Minimap 160x160 Binary Overview Buffer (25.6 KB)
GET {{Host}}/api/canvas/minimap

### Active Territory Reservations
GET {{Host}}/api/reservations/active
Accept: application/json

### Public Canvas Wall Studios Directory
GET {{Host}}/api/walls
Accept: application/json

### Canvas Region PNG Export (8-Bit Indexed PNG @ 4x Scale)
GET {{Host}}/api/canvas/export?x=0&y=0&width=200&height=200&scale=4

### Territory Reservation Lease Cost Preview
GET {{Host}}/api/tokens/cost-preview?width=50&height=50&durationMinutes=60
Accept: application/json

### Painter Bonus Token Balance (Requires JWT Bearer)
GET {{Host}}/api/tokens/balance
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Accept: application/json

### Claim Daily Reward Drop (+25 Bonus Tokens)
POST {{Host}}/api/tokens/claim-daily
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Accept: application/json

### Redeem Promo Code
POST {{Host}}/api/tokens/redeem
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WELCOME50"
}

### Token Transaction Audit History
GET {{Host}}/api/tokens/history
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Accept: application/json


